{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/number-systems/modular-arithmetic/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/number-systems/modular-arithmetic.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Modular Arithmetic — Congruences","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-teal-700 text-white py-3 mb-6\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"font-semibold\">Modular Arithmetic</div><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/number-systems/\" class=\"text-white/90\">Back</a></div></header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Idea</h2><div class=\"mt-2 text-gray-700\">a ≡ b (mod n) means n divides (a-b). Remainders wrap around — think of a clock.</div></section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Clock visual (mod 12)</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 flex justify-center\">\n        <svg width=\"220\" height=\"220\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"100\" fill=\"#dcfce7\" stroke=\"#16a34a\"></circle>\n          <text x=\"110\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0/12</text>\n          <text x=\"190\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n          <text x=\"110\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text>\n          <text x=\"30\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">9</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">1) 15 ≡ ? (mod 4)</div><input id=\"m1\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 3\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"mc1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-teal-700 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"mh1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"mfb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">2) (3+9) mod 5 = ?</div><input id=\"m2\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 2\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"mc2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-teal-700 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"mh2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"mfb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"mQuiz\" class=\"bg-teal-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Mini Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"mModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-40 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\"><div id=\"mContent\"></div><div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"mClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div></div></div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-teal-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}